{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/85f87ab3c720c1f9a89507413f764ec6.webp?t=1773163846\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/dba8644062b50499023cda337777f51c.poster.avif?t=1773163846\" width=630 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/dba8644062b50499023cda337777f51c.webm?t=1773163846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/dba8644062b50499023cda337777f51c.mp4?t=1773163846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete classified government contracts by undertaking dangerous sorties. Earn rewards for successful missions and collect resources at abandoned Soviet-era facilities. Plan your routes and extraction carefully. Move fast: the longer you stay on-site, the more aggressive the security systems become. All of this is required to upgrade your base and keep it operational. Radiation, traps, and autonomous security robots make every operation high-risk \u2014 a single mistake can be catastrophic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/ade07744f62b74a9a4918b364e8f29ce.webp?t=1773163846\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/434dc0d5bc91fbab2176aeef91c320c2.poster.avif?t=1773163846\" width=630 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/434dc0d5bc91fbab2176aeef91c320c2.webm?t=1773163846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/434dc0d5bc91fbab2176aeef91c320c2.mp4?t=1773163846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat robots \u2014 a legacy of the USSR \u2014 guard zones rich in valuable resources. They patrol facilities, block access to key areas, and attack any intruder. Destroy them to obtain rare components. Dozens of robot types, each with unique traits and vulnerabilities, require you to adapt your tactics to every situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/7ccb806caf46afa4ceae0aa0afe56a0f.webp?t=1773163846\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/245da78c236c4dcc3a318b2766c2d4e0.poster.avif?t=1773163846\" width=630 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/245da78c236c4dcc3a318b2766c2d4e0.webm?t=1773163846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/245da78c236c4dcc3a318b2766c2d4e0.mp4?t=1773163846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The base is the core of your progression and your main hub. All resources and money earned from contracts are invested into expanding the base, maintaining its modules, and upgrading your equipment. Here you can check and prepare your gear before a sortie and plan defenses against regular robot attacks. If the base is not properly maintained, the consequences will be severe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/0d36f9065bd0b310142090c92749e155.webp?t=1773163846\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative multiplayer for up to 4 players awaits you. Complete contracts together, assign roles, and operate as a coordinated team in hazardous zones. Built-in voice chat lets you coordinate quickly, make decisions on the fly, and get out of situations where solo survival chances are minimal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/8d6b4ad64e15239b798223a39deb7da2.avif?t=1773163846\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras_big/8d6b4ad64e15239b798223a39deb7da2.avif?t=1773163846 width=800 height=208 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574810?t=1773163846","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574810?t=1773163846","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/8d650d6f005b508cddc4ebf3b48c4393772ea611/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773163846","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/8d650d6f005b508cddc4ebf3b48c4393772ea611/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773163846","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/c2eb8f41cd0450f6c584149a05bd5dcb.avif?t=1773163846\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras_big/c2eb8f41cd0450f6c584149a05bd5dcb.avif?t=1773163846 width=800 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our <strong>Discord</strong> server to stay updated on the game development and more!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/85f87ab3c720c1f9a89507413f764ec6.webp?t=1773163846\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/dba8644062b50499023cda337777f51c.poster.avif?t=1773163846\" width=630 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/dba8644062b50499023cda337777f51c.webm?t=1773163846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/dba8644062b50499023cda337777f51c.mp4?t=1773163846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete classified government contracts by undertaking dangerous sorties. Earn rewards for successful missions and collect resources at abandoned Soviet-era facilities. Plan your routes and extraction carefully. Move fast: the longer you stay on-site, the more aggressive the security systems become. All of this is required to upgrade your base and keep it operational. Radiation, traps, and autonomous security robots make every operation high-risk \u2014 a single mistake can be catastrophic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/ade07744f62b74a9a4918b364e8f29ce.webp?t=1773163846\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/434dc0d5bc91fbab2176aeef91c320c2.poster.avif?t=1773163846\" width=630 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/434dc0d5bc91fbab2176aeef91c320c2.webm?t=1773163846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/434dc0d5bc91fbab2176aeef91c320c2.mp4?t=1773163846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat robots \u2014 a legacy of the USSR \u2014 guard zones rich in valuable resources. They patrol facilities, block access to key areas, and attack any intruder. Destroy them to obtain rare components. Dozens of robot types, each with unique traits and vulnerabilities, require you to adapt your tactics to every situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/7ccb806caf46afa4ceae0aa0afe56a0f.webp?t=1773163846\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/245da78c236c4dcc3a318b2766c2d4e0.poster.avif?t=1773163846\" width=630 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/245da78c236c4dcc3a318b2766c2d4e0.webm?t=1773163846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/245da78c236c4dcc3a318b2766c2d4e0.mp4?t=1773163846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The base is the core of your progression and your main hub. All resources and money earned from contracts are invested into expanding the base, maintaining its modules, and upgrading your equipment. Here you can check and prepare your gear before a sortie and plan defenses against regular robot attacks. If the base is not properly maintained, the consequences will be severe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/0d36f9065bd0b310142090c92749e155.webp?t=1773163846\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative multiplayer for up to 4 players awaits you. Complete contracts together, assign roles, and operate as a coordinated team in hazardous zones. Built-in voice chat lets you coordinate quickly, make decisions on the fly, and get out of situations where solo survival chances are minimal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/8d6b4ad64e15239b798223a3